# Two panes come back after a restart; in a 30x8 terminal only the focused Today pane shows, g1 shows the outline pane instead, and growing the terminal shows both again.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs
END
keys <C-w> s gt
restart
resize 30 8
see 󰖙 Today
hide Review PRs
keys g1
see Review PRs
hide 󰖙 Today
resize 100 30
see 󰖙 Today
keys G x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @done({today})
END
